# The app keeping itself current (mbui's src/host/win_update.h), on the files the sign-in left: the next build in the
# local cloud's releases, signed by a key of this run's that the app is given (e2e/win.sh: STILLFAIL_RELEASE_KEYS),
# found by the core's app.update once the app is signed in; 关于's version row offers it (更新到 0.1.<n+1>: the
# highest of the two, the settings' 关于 row under it saying so too). Pressed,
# it is asked for again, downloaded, checked against its signed SHA-256 and size and run as the desktop app's updater
# ran its installer, and this app quits as it starts (the run ends with it: `ends`, not `exit`, which would end the app
# before its host had started the installer); what came of it e2e/win.sh checks.
timeout 90000
answered {"topic":"accounts"}
gone 登录或注册
tap icon:settings
tap =关于
until 更新到 0.1.
tap1 更新到 0.1.
until 正在安装
ends
